My Trakt Wallpapers

This is a modified version of johnneerdael/traktlistbackdrops:
https://github.com/johnneerdael/traktlistbackdrops
Upstream revision: 4ade48e9f45de2bb2d2db1a5c35b087593ab2212

The upstream project is based on z9m/projectivy-tvbgsuite-plugin and the
Projectivy wallpaper provider sample. The original Apache License 2.0
is retained in LICENSE. Existing source notices remain in place.

Modifications made in October 2026 add personal Trakt lists, strict source
selection, complete pagination, secure on-device login storage, durable
wallpaper storage, scheduled background refresh, metadata rendering,
separate application/provider identity, tests, build automation, and guides.
See docs/UPSTREAM_REVIEW.md for the inspected upstream behavior and reuse.

